ople with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757898/000162828026046946/0001628280-26-046946-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.2% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757898/000162828026046946/0001628280-26-046946-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 36.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.36,"consecutive":2,"current":0.438,"current_display":"43.8%","threshold_display":"36.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -6.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.06,"consecutive":2,"current":0.092,"current_display":"9.2%","threshold_display":"-6.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":-0.003,"current_display":"-0.3%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"me